&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;DIVERSITY, EQUITY &amp;amp; INCLUSION:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Freenow is an equal opportunity employer and we consider qualified applicants regardless of race, religion, national origin, gender, gender identity, sexual orientation, disability or age. &lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We want you to grow and evolve, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;bring your true self to work&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT FREENOW:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Freenow by Lyft empowers smarter mobility decisions, helping people to move freely and cities to thrive. Through our multi-mobility app, we feature broad options for everyone across 9 European markets and over 180 cities. Millions of passengers can access services including taxis, private hire vehicles, carsharing, car rental, e-scooters, e-bikes, e-mopeds, and public transport within a single app.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In July 2025 Freenow was acquired by Lyft, a global mobility platform, which connects riders and drivers for billions of rides across North America and Europe. Together, Freenow and Lyft are creating a more caring and connected world, with transportation for everyone. We are a global, diverse, highly motivated, and collaborative team that strives for excellence and likes to have fun. Ready for your next ride?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.de/%C3%9Cberblick/Arbeit-bei-FREE-NOW-EI_IE954578.11,19.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/bltadef6ed7354e9cc4/65a10957984e23040a418da6/glassdoor-logotype-rgb_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.kununu.com/de/mytaxi-intelligent-apps&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://eu-images.contentstack.com/v3/assets/blt6e28a7086c72dd55/blte53af231aaa0c840/65a109382311a30407ba07ce/kununu_logo_black_2.png&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;150&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/free-now/life/2b1603ea-741a-49f8-9847-f1214f483a1a/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;img style=&quot;max-width: 100%;&quot; src=&quot;https://brand.linkedin.com/content/dam/me/business/en-us/amp/brand-site/v2/bg/LI-Logo.svg.original.svg&quot; alt=&quot;&quot; width=&quot;143&quot;&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI. At our core is the Celonis Context Model — which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence into a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can actually understand, turning AI&#39;s operational blind spots into operational clarity. World&#39;s leading companies trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. We believe there&#39;s a massive opportunity to unlock global productivity and sustainability by giving AI the context to understand how every business process really works. Join our mission to make processes work for people, companies, and the planet.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Team&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Celonis Services is the delivery engine of our Celonis Customer Organization, responsible for turning the Celonis platform into measurable, business-critical outcomes for our customers. In the AI era, our role has elevated: as AI agents like our own Apollo take on more of the technical build, our people focus on the work that drives real impact—understanding our customers&#39; business-critical problems, designing the solutions that solve them, and quantifying the value delivered. Our Deployment Engineers and Deployment Architects pair deep domain and industry expertise with serious platform mastery and AI-augmented delivery, directing agentic systems while owning the judgment, architecture, and customer relationships that AI cannot replace. We deliver faster and smarter than ever, and we own the outcome: initial value realization, adoption, and the long-term success of our customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Lead Deployment Architect - AI (known internally Lead Deployment Architect)&amp;nbsp;you are the technical authority for our strategic accounts within Celonis delivery. You shape how Celonis solutions are designed, architected, and delivered across your portfolio of strategic customer engagements. You define what good delivery looks like - setting architectural standards, designing end-to-end solution strategies, and ensuring that AI-augmented and agentic workflows are deployed effectively at scale.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You operate at the intersection of deep platform expertise, domain knowledge, and customer strategy. You are equally comfortable leading a technical design review with Celonis engineers and presenting a transformation roadmap to a customer’s C-suite. You bridge the gap between pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring that what was promised can be delivered - and often shaping the promise itself.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role carries significant organizational leverage. You set delivery patterns that other teams follow. You define how AI agents should be orchestrated for complex, multi-workstream engagements. You work in close collaboration with Deployment Engineers and raise the bar for the entire practice.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Work You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Solution Architecture &amp;amp; Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support Services scoping in pre-sales, ensuring the right Services are positioned in line with the Celonis solution architecture proposed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design end-to-end Celonis solution architectures for complex enterprise deployments, spanning multiple process areas, business units, and geographies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define the technical blueprint for how the Celonis platform integrates with customer systems, data strategies, and transformation goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing secure, scalable architectures tailored to complex enterprise requirements, optimizing for long-term usage growth and high concurrency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make architectural trade-off decisions: build vs. configure, custom vs. standard, phased vs. big-bang - with clear rationale tied to customer outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own solution quality &amp;amp; outcome delivery across engagements, conducting design reviews, and ensuring delivery teams follow architectural standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI Orchestration &amp;amp; Delivery Innovation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design how AI deployment agents (Apollo) should be used across complex, multi-workstream engagements, defining agent workflows, validation checkpoints, and quality gates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reusable specifications, templates, and patterns that enable Deployment Engineers to direct AI agents more effectively&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pioneer new delivery approaches that leverage AI to compress timelines, improve quality, or unlock use cases that were previously impractical&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set standards for AI output validation, ensuring the organization maintains quality as delivery accelerates&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Strategy &amp;amp; Advisory&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serve as the senior technical advisor to strategic customers, building trusted relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate customer business challenges into Celonis platform strategies, identifying high-impact use cases and defining success metrics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support pre-sales by providing technical credibility in complex deals, validating solution feasibility, and shaping project scope&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide customers through their Process Intelligence maturity journey, advising on platform expansion, AI readiness, and organizational change&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage the broader ecosystem of Celonis experts to remove potential blockers in customer engagements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish deep, technical advisor relationships with customer stakeholders (Lead Data Engineers and Architects, Head of Data Intelligence, Head of Business Transformation) to provide technical reassurance and maintain &quot;Expert-to-Expert&quot; alignment during the course of the deployment&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Successful Implementation&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work together with Deployment Engineers on delivery projects to implement the most complex and cutting edge use cases for our customers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay on top of the newest technologies Celonis has to offer and own the implementation of early stage products for our customers, ensuring close feedback cycles with Product &amp;amp; Engineering&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Review Solution(s) Blueprint to ensure quality, scalability and production readiness of business critical and operational use cases&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain &amp;amp; Industry Depth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain deep expertise in one or more process domains (e.g., Supply Chain, Order to Cash, Procure to Pay, IT Service Management) or industry verticals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate domain knowledge into scalable solution patterns, reference architectures, and best practices that the broader team can leverage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify and standardize high-value use cases within your domain in collaboration with the Deployment Engineer, collaborating with Product and Business Apps teams to shape the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Practice Development&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to hiring: define what great looks like for the Deployment job family, conduct interviews, and calibrate candidate assessments&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Share knowledge across the organization through internal enablement sessions, documentation, and community of practice leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure the link with Product &amp;amp; Engineering to feed customer insights and field experience back into platform development, and to influence the platform roadmap&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Distinguishes This Role from Deployment Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Scope: You work across multiple engagements and shape solutions across a portfolio/cluster/industry vertical (4+ concurrent clients)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence &amp;amp; Practice Development: your Scope allows you to identify and set standards that other teams follow - for solution architecture, AI orchestration patterns, and delivery quality&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bridge: You span pre-sales and post-sales, ensuring continuity between what’s sold and what’s delivered&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Force multiplier: Your work multiplies the effectiveness of Deployment Engineers rather than substituting for it&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Qualifications You Need&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience: &lt;/strong&gt;8+ years in technical consulting, solution architecture, or delivery leadership within enterprise software, consulting firms, or system integrators. At least 3 years in a senior or lead technical role with multi-stakeholder responsibility in large-scale projects at tier-1 organizations (e.g. digital twin implementations, global AI transformations, near-real-time data pipelines, etc.)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Architecture skills: &lt;/strong&gt;Proven ability to design complex, multi-component solutions that span data integration, process intelligence, automation, and AI, while remaining grounded in the “so-what” of a customer’s process. Deep understanding of enterprise architecture patterns and trade-offs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Platform mastery: &lt;/strong&gt;Expert-level knowledge of the Celonis platform, including the Process Intelligence Graph, data modeling, advanced PQL, automation and orchestration engine, and AI modules. Ability to push the platform’s boundaries via a working knowledge of Python.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;AI &amp;amp; agent orchestration: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to design AI-augmented delivery workflows leveraging frontier tooling (e.g., Claude Code, Codex, Cursor, etc.). Experience with context engineering, multi-agent system design, or AI validation at scale. Ability to define how AI should be used, not just use it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain expertise: &lt;/strong&gt;Deep knowledge in at least one major process domain or industry vertical. Ability to translate domain expertise into scalable solution patterns and credible customer advisory.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer executive presence: &lt;/strong&gt;Track record of building trusted advisor relationships with VP and C-level stakeholders. Ability to present transformation strategies, defend architectural decisions, and navigate complex organizational dynamics. Demonstrated experience navigating complex IT landscapes and communicating technical trade-offs to senior leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Consulting &amp;amp; communication: &lt;/strong&gt;Exceptional ability to translate between technical and business audiences. Experience leading workshops, design sessions, and strategic reviews with senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leadership &amp;amp; mentoring: &lt;/strong&gt;Demonstrated ability to raise the performance of teams around you. Experience mentoring technical staff, setting quality standards, and contributing to organizational capability development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education: &lt;/strong&gt;Bachelor’s or Master’s in Computer Science, Engineering, Technology Management, Business Informatics, or a comparable field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Languages: &lt;/strong&gt;Fluency in English and German required.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Celonis can offer you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Pioneer Innovation:&lt;/span&gt; Work with the global leader in Process Mining and the Process Intelligence Graph to shape the future of AI-driven business operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Ownership from Day 1:&lt;/span&gt; Every full-time &quot;Celonaut&quot; is an owner, receiving Restricted Stock Units (RSUs) and merit-based refresh grants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Unrivaled Family Support:&lt;/span&gt; Benefit from our inclusive parental leave policy—24 weeks of fully paid leave for primary carers and 12 weeks for supporting carers, available from your first day of employment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Work-Life Integration:&lt;/span&gt; Enjoy Unlimited PTO (in applicable regions) and generous PTO globally, as well as a flexible hybrid work model that balances remote focus with vibrant office collaboration.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Continuous Growth:&lt;/span&gt; Elevate your skills through our 70-20-10 learning framework, mentorship programs, and access to a dedicated learning platform.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Holistic Well-being:&lt;/span&gt; Prioritize your health with subsidized Wellhub memberships, mental health counseling, and dedicated &quot;Wellness Weeks&quot; that prioritize work/life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Drive Sustainability:&lt;/span&gt; Participate in annual Impact Days, where you receive paid time off to volunteer for community and environmental causes with your local office, or virtually.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Global Inclusion &amp;amp; Belonging:&lt;/span&gt; Find community through our Inclusion Think Tank and participate in our annual Inclusion Days, ensuring every voice is heard and valued.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-decoration: underline;&quot;&gt;Value-Driven Impact:&lt;/span&gt; Join a mission-led organization where our core values—Live for Customer Value, The Best Team Wins, We Own It, and Earth Is Our Future—drive every decision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Us:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1264&quot;&gt;Celonis is the trusted platform to industrialize Enterprise AI, empowering organizations to analyze, design, and operate AI-driven processes. The Celonis Platform is powered by the Celonis Context Model, which combines process data, business knowledge, and intelligence to create a living digital twin of the enterprise that AI can understand — turning AI’s operational blind spots into operational clarity. Industry-leading companies around the world trust Celonis and its global ecosystem of partners to make their AI agents, people, systems, and processes work together, achieving transformational outcomes. Celonis is headquartered in Munich, Germany, and New York City, USA, with more than 20 offices worldwide.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1982&quot;&gt;Get familiar with the Celonis Process Intelligence Platform by watching this &lt;a class=&quot;_ymio1r31 _ypr0glyw _zcxs1o36 _mizu194a _1ah3dkaa _ra3xnqa1 _128mdkaa _1cvmnqa1 _4davt94y _4bfu18uv _1hms8stv _ajmmnqa1 _vchhusvi _kqswh2mm _ect4ttxp _2rkolb4i _syaz13af _1a3b18uv _4fpr8stv _5goinqa1 _f8pj13af _9oik18uv _1bnxglyw _jf4cnqa1 _30l313af _1nrm18uv _c2waglyw _1iohnqa1 _9h8h12zz _10531ra0 _1ien1ra0 _n0fx1ra0 _1vhv17z1&quot; href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=YR5oRJGhJYg&amp;amp;list=PLuVor-ZUD4pnM6G33C5D0tjXUvlTPYBRe&quot; data-renderer-mark=&quot;true&quot; data-is-router-link=&quot;false&quot; data-testid=&quot;link-with-safety&quot;&gt;video&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celonis Inclusion Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Celonis, we believe our people make us who we are and that “The Best Team Wins”. We know that the best teams are made up of people who bring different perspectives to the table. And when everyone feels included, able to speak up and knows their voice is heard - that&#39;s when creativity and innovation happen.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Privacy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Any information you submit to Celonis as part of your application will be processed in accordance with Celonis’ &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/candidate-notices&quot;&gt;Accessibility and Candidate Notices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;By submitting this application, you confirm that you agree to the storing and processing of your personal data by Celonis as described in our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Privacy Notice for the Application and Hiring Process&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Use of Artificial Intelligence Tools&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We rely on an artificial intelligence tool to match the information from your resume to the relevant Celonis job descriptions. This processing is limited to the information provided in your resume or in your candidate profile. The tool produces a match score per candidate for a role, suggests preliminary ranking, and provides recommendations.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The tool is only used for support in parts of the job application process, including to facilitate the identification of the relevant Celonis Jobs for candidates and recruiters. All final decisions are made by hiring managers and the Celonis talent acquisition team. Hiring managers and HR specialists use this tool responsibly, are aware of the risk of potential bias, and are equipped to mitigate it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Please be aware of common job offer scams, impersonators and frauds. Learn more &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.celonis.com/careers/fraud-alert/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your wellbeing, our mission. Join a company shaping a healthier world.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GET TO KNOW US&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Wellhub we&#39;re revolutionizing workplace wellness. Our platform connects employees worldwide to the best partners for fitness, mindfulness, therapy, nutrition, and sleep—all in one simple subscription. Headquartered in NYC with team members in Europe, North America and South America, we’re on a mission to make every company a wellness company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe work should be fulfilling, inspiring, and balanced. Here, you’ll find a team that values wellbeing, collaboration, and different perspectives, where passion and creativity push boundaries to create real impact. Your contributions will help shape a healthier, more balanced world for you and millions of people globally.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join us in redefining the future of wellbeing!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE OPPORTUNITY&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are hiring a &lt;strong&gt;People Operations Working Student&lt;/strong&gt; to our &lt;strong&gt;People Operations&lt;/strong&gt; team in &lt;strong&gt;Berlin&lt;/strong&gt;!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is to join our People Operations team, dedicated to delivering an exceptional employee experience across Europe. In this role, you will contribute to meaningful People initiatives and gain valuable exposure to key HR topics including employment law, payroll, and HR systems (e.g., Personio), all within a fast-paced, international environment&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YOUR IMPACT&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Address and resolve employee queries with clarity and care by guiding them to the right resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support payroll processing by accurately entering and validating HR data in a timely manner.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist with internal audits, documentation, and the gathering of key compliance information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain accurate HR data in Personio and support reporting to inform data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to process optimization and strategic People projects spanning the entire employee lifecycle, including onboarding and offboarding.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Live the mission: inspire and empower others by genuinely caring for your own wellbeing and your colleagues. Bring wellbeing to the forefront of work, and create a supportive environment where everyone feels comfortable taking care of themselves, taking time off, and finding work-life wellness.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHO YOU ARE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A university student currently enrolled in HR, Business, or a related discipline, available to work between 15 and 20 hours per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A fluent communicator with C1+ level proficiency in both written and spoken German and English.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A Berlin-based candidate who can work on-site from our Head Office 2–3 times per week.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A discreet professional with a proven ability to handle confidential and sensitive information with high integrity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-driven, adaptable, and collaborative team player with excellent organizational skills and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive learner passionate about employee experience, eager to develop skills in project management, stakeholder management, and HR operations across Europe.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We recognize that individuals approach job applications differently. We strongly encourage all aspiring applicants to go for it, even if they don&#39;t match the job description 100%. We welcome your application and will be delighted to explore if you could be a great fit for our team. For this specific role, please note that &lt;strong&gt;current university enrollment and fluency in German and English (C1+) are mandatory requirements.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT WE OFFER YOU&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With thoughtful benefits, emotional wellbeing resources, and a culture that empowers you to take ownership of your role and your wellbeing, we create an environment where you can thrive in all dimensions of your life. Our benefits include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WELLHUB:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; Free Gold membership with access to onsite gyms and studios, digital fitness programs, and online wellness resources for meditation, nutrition, mental wellbeing support, and more! Add up to three family members to your plan, ensuring access to wellness for those who matter most to you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE WORK:&lt;/strong&gt; As a Flexible First company, we offer hybrid and remote options to give you the freedom to work in a way that suits you. The model for this specific role can be discussed with your recruiter and hiring manager. We offer all employees a one-time reimbursement to set up their home office equipment and a monthly work allowance to help cover the costs of working from home.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;FLEXIBLE SCHEDULE: &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;Flexibility for us isn’t just about where we work—it also means being able to shape how and when we get things done. Together with their leaders, employees define schedules that align with their time zones, team needs, and personal routines.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PAID TIME OFF:&lt;/strong&gt; We know how important it is to take time away from work to recharge.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;PARENTAL LEAVE:&lt;/strong&gt; Welcoming a new child is one of the most special moments in your life. Take the time to be present and enjoy your growing family. We offer 100% paid parental leave to all new parents. Parents giving birth are eligible for an extended leave and a ramp-back period to return part-time while they get settled.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CAREER GROWTH:&lt;/strong&gt; Access world-class platforms, participate in interactive sessions,&amp;nbsp; build your personalized development roadmap, and explore internal opportunities. We focus on continuous learning and feedback to support your journey toward personal and professional success.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CULTURE:&lt;/strong&gt; You’ll join a team of passionate people who come together to break boundaries, support each other, and create a meaningful impact in workplace wellness. We win together, building trust through open communication and a culture where every perspective matters. &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/our-values/&quot;&gt;Learn more about our shared culture and values here.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Want to see what it’s really like to work here? Follow us on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/lifeatwellhub/&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Instagram&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt; @lifeatwellhub and watch our team video on &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ZgIPiszTVm4&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;YouTube&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversity, Equity, and Belonging at Wellhub&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We aim to create a collaborative, supportive, and inclusive space where everyone knows they belong. At Wellhub, we welcome and celebrate your authentic self.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Wellhub is committed to creating a diverse work environment and is proud to be an equal opportunity employer. All qualified applicants will receive consideration for employment without regard to race, religion, color, sex, gender identity or expression, sexual orientation, age, non-disqualifying physical or mental disability, national origin, veteran status, or any other basis covered by appropriate law.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our commitment to inclusion also extends to how we recognize and reward our people. We’re proud to be Syndio Fair Pay Certified, reflecting our ongoing dedication to equitable and fair pay practices across our global team. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/posts/wellhub_fairpay-syndio-activity-7407826561531363328-wbN_?utm_source=share&amp;amp;utm_medium=member_desktop&amp;amp;rcm=ACoAAAzHQWABKsRqcpvxy4QpDCJNe_szRdC4hgY&quot;&gt;Read more about it here.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Questions on how we treat your personal data? See our &lt;a href=&quot;https://wellhub.com/en-us/careers/job-applicant-privacy-notice/&quot;&gt;Job Applicant Privacy Notice.&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(224, 62, 45);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com">Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin is the world’s leading platform for savings and investment products. Founded in 2012, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;FinTech&lt;/strong&gt; connects consumers with banks in the EU, the UK and the US. This gives consumers &lt;strong&gt;better interest rates&lt;/strong&gt; and banks a &lt;strong&gt;diversified form of refinancing&lt;/strong&gt;. Our vision is to offer savings and investments without barriers and thus open up the global 160 trillion euro market.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;sc-gEkIjz cjtSrT MuiTypography-root MuiTypography-body1 sc-hoLEA&quot;&gt;Raisin currently employs more than 800 people from over 75 countries worldwide. Today, the platform holds over 80 billion euros in assets from&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;more than one million investors&lt;/strong&gt; which have accrued over 5 billion euros in returns.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 0, 0);&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Team&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;Join the Deposits department, the group responsible for making some of Raisin’s most important strategic relationships grow and succeed. In a key dual role you will support both teams in the department.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Bank Analytics team drives Raisin’s business with analytics, research, and insights to platforms and wider funding markets. You’ll provide tailor-made funding guidance to our partner banks by leveraging internal and external data. The team’s analyses and guidance drive strategic decision-making both in- and outside the company.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We work closely with various departments and a multitude of stakeholders (e.g. partner banks, BusDev, Relationship Management, PR).&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Responsibilities&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;As a member of the Bank Analytics team, you will be a fundamental driver of Raisin’s growth by providing timely insights into current market and platform developments and behavior and guiding the funding strategies of our bank partners.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive market and funding intelligence: Analyze European and US deposit and funding markets, as well as customer behavior on our platforms to deliver clear, visual insights into key trends and uncover opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide strategic funding advice: Help partner banks navigate their funding goals by providing market indications, deposit forecasts, and actionable growth strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and enable: Develop a solid understanding of banks’ requirements and help align them with Raisin’s platform, working closely with other Raisin teams to help unlock growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years of relevant professional experience (including relevant internships) ideally in consulting, banking, or financial services.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent English communication skills, with the confidence to communicate clearly and professionally across teams; German nice-to-have.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong academic background in business, finance, economics, or a similar field.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High attention to detail and excellent organization skills.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A growth mindset, proactive attitude, and a strong willingness to be hands-on.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Nice to have: experience with SQL and/or Python&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Join our mission, join our team – and grow with us!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Raisin, we care about each other and it is one of our top priorities to foster an open and caring environment in which everyone feels welcome and comfortable. Our culture is strongly driven by our ambitious team, which connects more than 75 different nationalities.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As part of our team, you will benefit from&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Development Budget of €2,000 and four full training days per year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours, home office and 30 vacation days.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A company pension scheme (Betriebliche Altersvorsorge), which we support with 20%.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enjoy more than 50+ different sports with Urban Sports Club: We subsidize your membership with more than €20 per month.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Do you miss being in the office? The Deutschland Ticket gets you there, which we subsidize with €25 per month.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Love cycling? With JobRad, lease the bike of your choice and enjoy tax savings, plus Raisin covers your monthly insurance costs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hungry all the time? Snacks, daily fresh fruit as well as drinks provided at the office.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are moving from another country or city to join us? We may support your relocation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.raisin.com/corporate/raisin-applicant-privacy-policy/&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;Raisin Applicant Privacy Policy&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;728&quot; data-end=&quot;900&quot;&gt;We value diversity and the unique experiences each individual brings. If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;907&quot; data-end=&quot;1013&quot;&gt;We are an equal opportunity employer and are committed to creating an inclusive environment for everyone, regardless of race, colour, ancestry, religion, sex, national origin, sexual orientation, age, citizenship, marital status, disability, or gender identity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.com/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Germany</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h1&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco France recherche un·e&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;PDLC/SDLC Expert – Python &amp;amp; GenAI&lt;/strong&gt; pour accompagner les acteurs majeurs de la banque et des services financiers dans l&#39;optimisation et la transformation de leurs cycles de développement produit et logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Au sein de notre Practice Technology &amp;amp; Engineering, vous interviendrez à l’intersection du Software Engineering, de l’automatisation et de l’intelligence artificielle pour concevoir et déployer des solutions améliorant la qualité, la rapidité et la fiabilité du développement logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous travaillerez aux côtés des équipes Engineering, Architecture, DevOps et Product pour analyser les pratiques existantes, identifier les opportunités d’amélioration et accompagner l’évolution des méthodes de développement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vous jouerez un rôle clé dans l’intégration de la GenAI et des workflows AI-enabled au sein des cycles PDLC/SDLC, de la conception à la mise en production, en veillant à maintenir la supervision humaine, la sécurité, la traçabilité et les standards de qualité.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vos missions :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Analyser et optimiser les cycles Product Development Lifecycle (PDLC) et Software Development Lifecycle (SDLC) afin d’améliorer la qualité, la productivité et la fiabilité des processus de développement.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Concevoir et développer des solutions et outils d’automatisation en Python, notamment pour les activités de développement, de tests, de validation et de maintenance logicielle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Intégrer des capacités de GenAI et des workflows AI-enabled dans les pratiques d’ingénierie, notamment pour l’assistance au développement, la génération et la revue de code, la documentation et l’automatisation des tests.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Collaborer avec les équipes Engineering, DevOps, Architecture et Product pour industrialiser les solutions, renforcer les pratiques CI/CD et accompagner leur adoption.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Évaluer l’efficacité des solutions déployées et garantir une utilisation responsable de l’IA, avec des mécanismes de contrôle, de validation humaine, de traçabilité et d’escalade adaptés aux environnements réglementés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Votre profil :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul data-spread=&quot;false&quot;&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience significative en Software Engineering, avec une expertise confirmée en Python et une bonne compréhension des architectures et pratiques de développement logiciel.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une solide connaissance des cycles PDLC/SDLC, des méthodologies Agile, des pratiques DevOps, CI/CD et des principes de qualité logicielle.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience pratique de l’utilisation de la GenAI dans le développement logiciel, notamment des assistants de programmation, des LLMs ou des outils d’automatisation des workflows d’ingénierie.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une capacité à analyser des processus complexes, identifier des leviers d’optimisation et concevoir des solutions techniques adaptées aux besoins des équipes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une approche collaborative permettant de travailler avec des équipes techniques et métiers, associée à une compréhension des enjeux de sécurité, de gouvernance et de Responsible AI. Vous êtes à l’aise pour travailler en français et en anglais dans des environnements internationaux.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience de mise en œuvre de solutions AI-assisted Software Development, notamment pour la génération de code, les tests automatisés ou l&#39;amélioration des pratiques DevSecOps.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Une expérience dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux, l&#39;assurance ou d&#39;autres environnements financiers réglementés.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pourquoi rejoindre Capco?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco est un cabinet de conseil international, spécialisé dans les services financiers.&lt;br&gt;Fondé en 1998, le cabinet compte aujourd’hui plus de 7 000 collaborateurs dans 36 bureaux à travers le monde, dont 160 à Paris.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Challenger reconnu face aux grands noms du conseil, Capco se distingue par sa double expertise métier et technologique, au service de la stratégie comme de l’exécution.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Notre promesse : accompagner la transformation de nos clients dans un monde en constante mutation – réglementaire, technologique et opérationnel.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Nous intervenons à l’intersection du business, de la réglementation et de la tech, en mobilisant des équipes pluridisciplinaires, expérimentées et engagées.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Nos marqueurs distinctifs :&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une spécialisation sectorielle forte&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous apportons à nos clients une compréhension approfondie de leurs enjeux métiers, en particulier dans la banque, les marchés de capitaux et l’énergie.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une approche collaborative et sur mesure&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nous intégrons les équipes clients, adaptons nos méthodes à leur culture et co-construisons des solutions concrètes et opérationnelles.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;L’excellence comme exigence&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Notre ambition est d’obtenir des résultats mesurables et durables pour nos clients – et de toujours viser la valeur ajoutée.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Un esprit “One Capco”&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Nos équipes collaborent à l’échelle internationale pour mobiliser les meilleures expertises et partager les bonnes pratiques.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Une culture entrepreneuriale et inclusive&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;L’innovation, l’initiative et le mérite sont au cœur de notre modèle. Nous valorisons les idées, la diversité et le progrès collectif.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
